    "description": "Cottage, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Timber cottage: cobblestone base, oak plank walls between upright spruce posts, spruce gable roof on a top plate, brick chimney on the back gable; bed, chest, hearth, table inside. Not yet builder-tested: azure_bluet, candle, dandelion, moss_carpet. Decoration step adds: item_frame, potted_plant.",
    "changes": "Every log now has an explicit axis (upright spruce posts, beams lying along the walls); the window holes now have glass; the gables are jettied out flush with the roof so there is no dark gap under it; the dormer stairs and the campfire on the chimney (the \"couch\" on the roof) are gone; and each level adds much more detail: window boxes, shutters, corbels, lantern posts and a front fence, a woodpile, a bench, a composter and crates, and more furniture inside.",
